  83RU           | Legion Pro 7 16     | 0x04      | \_SB.PCI0.LPC0.EC0.FASF (Fan3) |  8-bit | 100
+ 82KR           | IdeaPad 3 15ADA6    | 0x06      | \_SB.PCI0.LPC0.EC0.FANS        |  8-bit | 100
+ 81YQ           | IdeaPad 5 15ARE05   | 0x06      | \_SB.PCI0.LPC0.EC0.FANS        |  8-bit | 100
