+ 82Y5           | Legion Slim 5 14APH8| 0x06/0xFE | \_SB.PCI0.LPC0.EC0.FANS/FA2S   |  8-bit | 100
+ 83F5           | Legion Pro 7 16IAX10| 0x03/0x06 | \_SB.PC00.LPCB.EC0.FANS/FA2S   |  8-bit | 100
