+ 81JS           | YOGA 730-15IWL      | 0x06      | \_SB.PCI0.LPCB.EC0.ERPM        |  8-bit | 100
+ 83HM           | Yoga Slim 7 15ILL9  | 0x06/0xFE | \_SB.PC00.LPCB.EC0.FANS/FA2S   | 16-bit | 1
